# Browser
# A look at a hidden card is the looker's alone: Bot1's Urza's Bauble looks at a card at random in Bot2's hand of Islands,
# and Bot1's log names it; Bot2's Bauble then looks at one of Bot1's, and Bot1's log says only that Bot2 looked at a card.
# The same event carries Medomai's Prophecy's look at the top card of each library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Urza's Bauble
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Urza's Bauble
Island x7

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Urza's Bauble.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Urza's Bauble.Activate(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Log.Has = You look at [Island].
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Urza's Bauble.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Urza's Bauble.Activate(Bot1)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Log.Has = Bot2 looks at a card.

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Urza's Bauble
Bot2.Graveyard = Urza's Bauble
